        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babaandu baboolela Yeremia abasabile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babemeelesi be banamae boosi ne Yoanani okhwa Karea ne Asaria okhwa Hosiaya ne babaandu boosi khukhwamila khu mukeekhe khukhwola khu mukali bacha siimbi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala baboolela omung'oosi Yeremia bali, “Nosiima khukhusaba okhurekeeresie, mala okhusabile Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo. Sikila nga wesi ne obona, khwaba bakali, mala luno khwaramire batiiti busa bari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, khusabile nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo akhwekesie efwe engila niyo khuchila ne bibiindu nibio khukhoyele khukhole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omung'oosi Yeremia abakobosia ali, “Namuulile, ndasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe khuloondekhana ne lisaba lienywe, ne liosi liosi nilio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amukobosia enywe, ese ndamuboolela, se ndamukisakho sisiindu siosi siosi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio baboolela Yeremia bali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhoya abe omuloli owa ng'ali lundi omusuubilwa khwifwe, khwaba ne khukhakhola khuloondekhana ne burume bwewe bwoosi nibwo akhuruma ewe khwifwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwakhaba ne buli bulayi namwe bubi efwe khulaulila nilio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe niye khulikho khukhurumakho, nio khunyoole bulayi khwaba ne khuloonda nilio aloma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likobosia lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khu lisaba lia Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we chindaalo ekhumi, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alomaloma ne Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yeremia alanga Yoanani okhwa Kerea ne banamae babemeelesi boosi ba baaba naye ne babaandu boosi khukhwamila khu mukeekhe khukhwola khu mukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aababoolela kamakhuwa kano: Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli niye enywe mundumirekho ese mbile lisaba lienywe ebweeni wewe aloma ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enywe mwaba ne murama mu sibala sino, ese ndamwombakha ne se ndamulekha tawe. Ndamwimikha ne se ndamwonaka tawe. Sikila ese nisonia khu butinyu nibwo namurereere enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukharia omwami owa Babiloni niye muriire khale oyo tawe, sikila ese ndi ne nanywe khumuonia ne khumureesia khukhwama mu bunyali bwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamukholela enywe siisa, mala omwami owa Babiloni yesi amukholele siisa mala amulekhe muche mu sibala sienywe sisiene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali mwaba ne muloma muli, “Efwe se khwenya khwarama mu sibala sino tawe,” mwaba ne mukharia niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe aloma tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namwe mwaba ne muloma muli khulacha mu sibala sia Misiri niio khukhabona liie, namwe chikhoombi che liie namwe enjala tawe mala mumenye ebweeneyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba ulila niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma, ee enywe mumwarama mu Yuda. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aloma ali, “Mwaaba ne mulola e Misiri muche mumenyeyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba liie nilio muriire likhamunyoole mu sibala sie Misiri esio, ne enjala niyo muriire elamuloondakho ne kamaani mala emwirireyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu boosi baacha e Misiri khumenyayo baleerwa mwiie, mu njala, ne lufu, se balaba nende omundu olarama namwe olaona khukhwama khu busiku nibwo ndabareerera tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sikila ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli ndoma ndi: Nga naambwa lirima likali, nakhalalila bamenywa ba Yerusalemu, bulayi bwene khaambwe lirima ne khumukhalalila enywe mwaba ne mucha e Misiri. Mulafwaana bubi lukali, muriisie mube nga silaamo lundi be khuchekheelelwa. Se mulibona abuundu ano lundi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, enywe mumwarama mu Yuda, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amuboolela ali, “Mukhacha e Misiri tawe. Manyila elala ng'ali muli namukaanisie endaalo yino ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaukhe mala mweyire mwabeene. Sikila enywe mwanduma ese khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe ne muboola muli, ‘Khusabile khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe, ne liosi liosi nilio aloma, ewe khuboolele mala khulakhola.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne endaalo yino ese namubooleele ne kakhali se mwariire burume bwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe mu buli siindu nisio amboleele muboolele enywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako luno manya ng'ali muli mukhererwe mwiie ne njala, ne lufu mu sibala nisio mwikoomba khucha mumenyemo esio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
